[*] GTKWave save file for the end-to-end ARP request -> reply trace.
[*] Generate the matching dump with:
[*]   make -B UNIT=frame_parser_arp_top WAVES=1 COCOTB_TEST_FILTER=test_arp_request_end_to_end
[*] Then open with:
[*]   gtkwave sim_build/frame_parser_arp_top/frame_parser_arp_top.fst arp_e2e.gtkw
